<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">conviction-barrage</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Conviction Barrage</ansi> spell unleashes a devastating storm of
crystallized belief shards that tear into every enemy in the room.
Among the most destructive area spells available, it demands great
conviction and considerable preparation to cast.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast conviction-barrage</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Area
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Elemental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 24
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 160
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Physical — target's armor resists the shards
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Massive damage to all enemies in the room

